  "summary": "Malicious code in donutautosellsrc (PyPI)",
  "details": "During installation package fetches code hidden in an image containing a Python application with a native extension module. This module holds an obfuscated infostealer which collects sensitive data and exfiltrates them to a C2 server retrieved from transaction history in Polygon blockchain.\n\n\n---\n\nCategory: MALICIOUS - The campaign has clearly malicious intent, like infostealers.\n\n\nCampaign: 2026-09-donutautosellsrc\n\n\nReasons (based on the campaign):\n\n\n - Downloads and executes a remote executable.\n\n\n - steganography\n\n\n - malware\n\n\n - native-extension\n\n\n - infostealer\n\n\n - obfuscation\n\n\n - c2-in-blockchain\n\n",
